<section id="modes">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow sec-head">Four globes in one</p>
    <h2 class="sec-head">Pick the planet that fits your mood</h2>
    <p class="section-lede sec-head">Every mode is the same living world — your trips, lenses and
      timeline carry across all of them.</p>
    <div class="mode-grid">
      <div class="mode-card">
        <div class="mode-swatch sw-cartoon"></div>
        <h3>Cartoon terrain</h3>
        <p>Hand-styled mountains and coasts, built live from real elevation data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mode-card">
        <div class="mode-swatch sw-clay"></div>
