      </div>
      <div class="mode-card">
        <div class="mode-swatch sw-satellite"></div>
        <h3>Satellite</h3>
        <p>Real imagery when you want to see the actual place from above.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mode-card">
        <div class="mode-swatch sw-photoreal"></div>
